(text "BUTTONS (4): SMD tactile, RC debounce 100nF + 10k pullup to V3P3, ESD TVS to GND.\nRF-ACTIVE LED: red 0603, 1k series, driven HIGH = ON. This LED is wired in HARDWARE\n  in series with the rf_safety arbiter logic so it cannot lie about TX state.\nSTATUS LED: WS2812B-2020 RGB on the front panel, V3P3 + 100nF, data from a free GPIO.\nMICROSD: standard push-push card cage, shares SPI_RF bus, dedicated SD_CS. Card detect\n  pin to a free GPIO with 10k pullup. Series 33 ohm on SCK/MOSI/MISO for SI."
	(at 100 30 0)
	(effects
		(font (size 1.27 1.27))
		(justify left top)
	)
	(uuid "47e9c8dd-c9b6-4ffb-9ca3-f9833ec291f6")
)
